# CHANGES.log

## 2026-05-25 - QA integral y ajuste Quick Add
- Ran full technical QA: build, lint, npm audit, dataset integrity, SM-2 guard checks, migration checks, API connectivity, and browser verification on desktop/tablet.
- Verified DeepSeek, Ollama, Google Apps Script ping, and MyMemory translation endpoints without exposing secrets.
- Fixed Quick Add language detection so natural Spanish phrases such as "la escena no termina de funcionar" are translated as Spanish-to-English in auto mode.
- Branch: main
