## 2026-05-25 - Captura bilingue de vocabulario
- Reworked quick add into a bidirectional vocabulary capture flow for Spanish-to-English and English-to-Spanish entries.
- Updated AI autofill prompts to accept either language and return a natural English expression plus Spanish source, usage metadata, blocks, examples, mistakes, alternatives, and tags.
- Added language mode selection, editable enriched fields, multi-block assignment, TTS preview, and duplicate warnings before saving.
- Branch: main
- Status: Build, lint, and browser modal verification passing.

## 2026-05-25 - Reconexion automatica del estado de IA
- Added automatic AI status refresh in Settings after page load, window focus, visibility changes, and every 15 seconds.
- Added a manual "Recomprobar" action so Ollama and DeepSeek status can recover without reopening the app.
- Branch: main
- Status: Build, lint, and browser Settings verification passing.

## 2026-05-25 - Restauracion automatica del vocabulario base
- Fixed expression loading so the 173 base vocabulary entries are always merged into existing local data instead of only loading on empty storage.
